title: AEnd2Day1
//WARM
position: -1106,-1035
color: green
group: FamA && Day1
---
<<set $relationshipFamA += 2>>
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: THANK YOU! It's perfect!
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Thanks again! We'll see you around.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
