//FAM A — DAY 1 — BACKPACK (BROKEN / FLATTENED)
title: FamA
when: ($day == 1) && ($package == "backpack") && ($packageState == "Broken" || $packageState == "Flattened")
position: -1637,-804
color: purple
group: FamA && Day1
---
<<set $famA_D2_damageCount = 1>>
<<setBackground "BGFamA">>
<<once>>
Mailman: Good afternoon! Are you—
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SpeakingTired">>
Lina: Is that my daughter's package? It's completely crushed!
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: I'm terribly sorry — it must've been damaged in transport.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: This is unacceptable. She needs that backpack for tomorrow.
-> Mailman: I'll file a report and make sure it's replaced immediately.
    <<jump FamA_D1_Broken_Kind>>
-> Mailman: You can report it to the depot if you'd like.
    <<jump FamA_D1_Broken_Neutral>>
-> Mailman: It left the warehouse fine, these things happen.
    <<jump FamA_D1_Broken_Cold>>
<<else>>
...
<<endonce>>
===
title: FamA_D1_Broken_Kind
group: FamA && Day1
color: green
position: -1112,-751
---
<<set $relationshipFamA += 0>>
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Alright. Please make sure it doesn't happen again.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaListeningTired">>
Mailman: I will. I'm truly sorry. Good evening.
<<hideCharacter "Lina">>
<<hideBackground>>
===

title: FamA_D1_Broken_Neutral
group: FamA && Day1
