//FAM A — DAY 2 — UNIFORM (PRISTINE / SLIGHTLY DAMAGED)
title: FamA
when: ($day == 2) && ($package == "uniform") && ($packageState == "Pristine" || $packageState == "SlightlyDamaged")
//undamaged package
color: purple
group: FamA && Day2
position: -1633,318
---
<<once>>
<<setBackground "BGFamA">>
Mailman: Good afternoon, Lina! More school supplies, I'm guessing.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: You guessed right. Sofie's uniform finally arrived.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Hello Mr.Mailman...
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Hello Sofie, are you excited about your new uniform?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: At least I'll fit in… I still wish I had something nice to wear outside of school.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: I'm sorry, Sofie. The uniform was already too expensive.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: I know… it just feels like everyone else has cooler stuff.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: Don’t be too hard on yourself. You’ll find your people. 
    <<jump FamA_D2_En_Undamaged_Kind>>
-> Mailman: You should listen to your mother.
    <<jump FamA_D2_End_Undamaged_Cold>>
-> Mailman: I might have something for you. <<if $verasClothes == true>>
    <<jump FamA_D2_En_Undamaged_VerasPkg>>
<<else>>
<<setBackground "BGFamA">>
...
<<hideBackground>>
<<endonce>>
===

title: FamA_D2_En_Undamaged_Kind
group: FamA && Day2
color: green
position: -1383,174
