Sofie: I didn't mean to complain… I just wish I could wear something new for once. 
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: I get it. And try not to be so hard on Mom, she's doing her best.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
